### 6. **Missing HTTPS Enforcement (A02:2021 – Cryptographic Failures)**
**Issue:** No redirection to HTTPS and no SSL/TLS configuration.

**Risk:**
- Credentials and sensitive data transmitted in plaintext
- Man-in-the-middle attacks possible
- Vulnerable to network sniffing

**Recommendation:**
```javascript
const https = require('https');
const fs = require('fs');

// In production, enforce HTTPS
if (process.env.NODE_ENV === 'production') {
  app.use((req, res, next) => {
    if (!req.secure) {
      return res.redirect(301, `https://${req.host}${req.url}`);
    }
    next();
  });

  // Load SSL certificates
  const options = {
    key: fs.readFileSync(process.env.SSL_KEY_PATH),
    cert: fs.readFileSync(process.env.SSL_CERT_PATH),
  };
  https.createServer(options, app).listen(443);
} else {
  app.listen(3000, () => {
    console.log('Server running on port 3000 (DEV - not HTTPS)');
  });
}
```

